{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.WedderburnMass.chirality_residue_mass_term","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.chirality_residue_mass_term","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.chirality_residue_mass_term","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.chirality_residue_mass_term","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/chirality_residue_mass_term.lean#L42-L62","doc":"**Proposition statement** (from manuscript):\n\nPer the\n[unified curvature-rank mass formula](#prop:unified-curvature-rank-mass-formula),\nthe categorical mass of a knot $\\mathcal{K}$ probed by test element\n$\\mathcal{T} \\in A = H_n(R, q)$ decomposes as a sum over GB-filtration\nstrata.  This proposition refines that decomposition by splitting each\nstratum into a\n\n    The Lean encoding below derives the achiral/chiral stratum split from\n    the `ChiralityResidueMassTermContext` fields (§3b-cond conditional) —\n    `rw [mass_sum_strata]; congr; ext; exact mass_stratum_decomp`; the\n    conjectural content lives in those class fields, not in a `sorry`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:chirality-residue-mass-term","label":"prop:chirality-residue-mass-term","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/chirality-residue-mass-term.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext.mass_stratum_decomp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext.mass_stratum_decomp","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/chirality_residue_mass_term.lean#L40-L40","doc":"The stratum mass decomposes into achiral and chiral parts. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext.mass_sum_strata","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext.mass_sum_strata","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/chirality_residue_mass_term.lean#L38-L38","doc":"The total mass is the sum over all strata of the stratum masses. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext.mass_stratum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext.mass_stratum","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/chirality_residue_mass_term.lean#L36-L36","doc":"Total mass contribution from stratum `s`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext.mass_chiral","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext.mass_chiral","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/chirality_residue_mass_term.lean#L34-L34","doc":"Mass contribution per stratum from the chiral (residue) part. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext.mass_achiral","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext.mass_achiral","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/chirality_residue_mass_term.lean#L32-L32","doc":"Mass contribution per stratum from the achiral (mirror-symmetric)\npart. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext.n_strata","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext.n_strata","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/chirality_residue_mass_term.lean#L29-L29","doc":"Number of GB-filtration strata. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext.mass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext.mass","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/chirality_residue_mass_term.lean#L27-L27","doc":"Categorical mass `𝔪(K, T)` of knot `K` probed by test element `T`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext.CategoricalObj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext.CategoricalObj","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/chirality_residue_mass_term.lean#L25-L25","doc":"The categorical object / monoidal structure. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/WedderburnMass/chirality_residue_mass_term.lean#L23-L23","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ChiralityResidueMassTermContext","kind":"cl